    {
      "id": 9400,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Provenance",
      "description": "Incident scope. Variables are filters; suspects use fleet metrics. role=scope_provenance; scope=pipeline,run_type,provider",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Incident scope\n- workflow=`$workflow` pipeline=`$pipeline` run_type=`$run_type`\n- provider filter=`$provider` (optional)\n- Deep identity → Run Explorer; resume safety → Trust"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9401,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Status",
      "description": "Worst-of L0 status for selected pipeline/run_type (bioetl_l0_status). Confidence is low when series absent.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(bioetl_l0_status{pipeline=~\"$pipeline\",run_type=~\"$run_type\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "WARN",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "2": {
                  "text": "CRIT",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "UNKNOWN",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "noValue": "UNKNOWN"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2001,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Next Best Actions",
      "description": "Phase-2 Incident CTAs: navigation bus owns dashboard handoffs to avoid duplicate target UIDs. Domain suspect tables below rank evidence.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<h3>Next Best Actions (≤4)</h3><ol style='margin:0.2rem 0 0 1.1rem;padding:0'><li>Read Status strip (L0 worst-of).</li><li>Scan domain suspect tables (Runtime / Provider / DQ) — not one mega-OR.</li><li>Open matching workspace via Navigation bus (time range preserved).</li><li>Empty all tables + Status OK = VALID EMPTY; empty with CRIT = TELEMETRY/projection gap.</li></ol>"
      },
      "links": []
    },
